                <p>For correspondence concerning this agreement and other illustrations of wartime
                    cooperation between Germany and the Soviet Union, see <ref
                        target="frus1940v01#pg_539">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Foreign Relations</hi>, 1940, vol. <hi
                            rendition="#small-caps">i</hi>, pp. 539</ref> ff.</p>
            </note>
